window.LX={"dest":{"jordan":{"name":"Jordan","slug":"jordan","url":"jordan-dmc-india","notes":[],"topbar":null,"intro":["Jordan, with its rich history, stunning landscapes, and warm hospitality, is a destination that captivates individuals and corporates from around the world. To truly experience the wonders of Jordan, one needs a trusted partner. Luxxata has in-depth understanding of Jordan and ensures that everyone experiences the authentic essence of the destination.","Luxxata curates personalized itineraries that cater to the unique preferences and interests. Whether you're an adventure seeker, a history buff, a luxury connoisseur or a corporate wanting memories for small meetings or integrated conferences, Luxxata has the perfect itinerary for you.","Luxxata means you can leave all the logistics to the capable hands. From transportation to accommodation to sightseeing, every detail is meticulously planned and executed, so you can focus on enjoying your trip. If you're looking to explore Jordan in style and comfort, look no further than Luxxata."],"slides":[{"img":"2024/05/jordan-s1.jpg","cap":"Relive the thrills of Indiana Jones at the Treasury"},{"img":"2024/05/jordan-s4-wadirum.jpg","cap":"Adventure a desert like no other: Wadi Rum"},{"img":"2024/05/jordan-s6-deadsea.jpg","cap":"Experience the uniqueness of floating in the Dead Sea"}],"hlTitle":"Jordan Top Highlights","highlights":[["The Marvels of Wadi Rum","Immerse yourself in the otherworldly landscapes of Wadi Rum, a vast desert known for its dramatic sandstone mountains and red sand dunes."],["Unmatched Weightlessness at the Dead Sea","Float in waters of the Dead Sea, the lowest point on Earth, and experience the sensation of weightlessness."],["Stunning Landscapes of Dana Biosphere Reserve","Hike through the lush valleys and waterfalls of Dana Biosphere Reserve, a haven for biodiversity and eco-tourism."],["Majestic Rock-Carved Marvels of the Ancient World","Explore the ancient city of Petra, a UNESCO World Heritage Site known for its stunning rock-carved architecture."],["Authentic Bedouin Hospitality","Experience the hospitality of the Bedouin tribes in Wadi Rum, who offer authentic desert experiences and cultural insights."]],"pkgTitle":"Jordan Tour Packages","pkgSub":"Rich history, stunning landscapes, and warm hospitality.) Each card: image, name + nights, night split, \"Ask for details\" (currently links to #","pkgs":[{"img":"2025/02/Jordan_Amman-Citadel.jpg","title":"Jordan Tour Package 10 Nights","split":"3N Amman, 2N Petra, 1N Wadi rum, 3N Aqaba, 1N Amman","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"Amman"},{"n":2,"t":"Petra"},{"n":1,"t":"Wadi rum"},{"n":3,"t":"Aqaba"},{"n":1,"t":"Amman"}]},{"img":"2025/02/Ajloun-Castle_Jordan.jpg","title":"Best of Jordan 7 Nights","split":"3N Amman, 2N Petra, 1N Wadi rum, 1N Amman","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"Amman"},{"n":2,"t":"Petra"},{"n":1,"t":"Wadi rum"},{"n":1,"t":"Amman"}]},{"img":"2025/02/float-in-the-dead-sea-jordan.jpg","title":"Discover Jordan 7 Nights","split":"1N Amman, 2N Dead Sea, 1N Amman, 2N Petra, 1N Amman","stops":[{"n":1,"t":"Amman"},{"n":2,"t":"Dead Sea"},{"n":1,"t":"Amman"},{"n":2,"t":"Petra"},{"n":1,"t":"Amman"}]},{"img":"2025/02/Petra-jordan2.jpg","title":"Jordan Essentials 4 Nights","split":"1N Amman, 2N Petra, 1N Amman","stops":[{"n":1,"t":"Amman"},{"n":2,"t":"Petra"},{"n":1,"t":"Amman"}]},{"img":"2025/02/wadi_rum.jpg","title":"Adventures Jordan 7 Nights","split":"1N Amman, 2N Dead Sea, 2N Petra, 1N Wadi rum, 1N Amman","stops":[{"n":1,"t":"Amman"},{"n":2,"t":"Dead Sea"},{"n":2,"t":"Petra"},{"n":1,"t":"Wadi rum"},{"n":1,"t":"Amman"}]}]},"egypt":{"name":"Egypt","slug":"egypt","url":"egypt-dmc-india","notes":[],"topbar":null,"intro":["Luxxata, the premier Travel DMC for Egypt, extends a warm invitation to experience the wonders of Egypt, where ancient treasures and modern marvels collide. From the iconic Pyramids of Giza to the serene banks of the Nile River, we promise an unforgettable journey through this land of pharaohs and legends.","Our expert team ensures that every aspect of your Egyptian adventure is meticulously planned and seamlessly executed. Whether you're exploring the bustling streets of Cairo, embarking on a Nile River cruise, or venturing into the depths of the ancient temples of Luxor, we provide an insider access and unparalleled experiences.","Let Luxxata be the guide you trust for your Egypt tour package, where each day is filled with discovery and wonder. Whether it's uncovering hidden archaeological treasures, immersing yourself in the vibrant culture, or simply savoring the flavors of authentic Egyptian cuisine, Luxxata will ensure that your journey through Egypt is nothing short of extraordinary."],"slides":[{"img":"2024/05/egypt-s1-1.jpg","cap":"Explore Ancient Wonders. Visit the Pyramids of Giza, one of the Seven Wonders of the Ancient World, and marvel at the enigmatic Sphinx."},{"img":"2024/05/egypt-s3-1.jpg","cap":"Sample Local Flavors. Explore the vibrant Khan el-Khalili Bazaar in Cairo, where you can shop for souvenirs, spices, and handmade crafts, and savor traditional Egyptian cuisine."},{"img":"2024/05/egypt-s2-1.jpg","cap":"Cruise the Legendary Nile. Embark on a luxurious Nile River cruise to Luxor and Aswan, where you’ll uncover ancient temples, tombs, and villages along the riverbanks."}],"hlTitle":"Egypt Top Highlights","highlights":[["The pyramids at Giza & The Sphinx","Host corporate events or just visit in day lights to tick your checklist for this magnificent marvel from Egyptian history."],["World-class luxury resorts","Beach resorts with all inclusive meal plans for a perfect leisure holiday and sea excursions with magnificent marine life of the red sea."],["Gala Dinners and Nile Cruises","Egyptian delicacies, Belly Dance and folk performances, nile cruise dinner experience is a entertainment pack just right for any Leisure or incentive trip"],["Desert safari and Oasis camps","Get away from city hustle & bustle in zero pollution environment, heal your body with a dip in salt pool and relish the Egyptian hospitality with overnight camp stay on the desert"],["Nightlife","Egypt is packed with some of the most fascinating night clubs and lounges aspired by party lovers from all parts of the world."]],"pkgTitle":"Egypt Tour Packages","pkgSub":"Classical or adventure tour in desert, a relaxing vacation by the sea","pkgs":[{"img":"2024/05/red-sea-tour2.jpg","title":"Egypt on Nile Cruise Extended 9 Nights","split":"2N Cairo, 3N Nile Cruise, 3N Hurghada, 1N Cairo","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Cairo"},{"n":3,"t":"Nile Cruise"},{"n":3,"t":"Hurghada"},{"n":1,"t":"Cairo"}]},{"img":"2024/05/dinner-cruise-egypt-tour.jpg","title":"Egypt Nile Cruise Packages 8 Nights","split":"2N Cairo, 3N Nile Cruise, 2N Hurghada, 1N Cairo","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Cairo"},{"n":3,"t":"Nile Cruise"},{"n":2,"t":"Hurghada"},{"n":1,"t":"Cairo"}]},{"img":"2024/05/classic-egypt-tour-1.jpg","title":"Classic Egypt Tour 5 Nights","split":"2N Cairo, 3N Nile Cruise","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Cairo"},{"n":3,"t":"Nile Cruise"}]},{"img":"2024/05/hurghada-egypt-tour.jpg","title":"Pyramids and Beaches of Egypt 4 Nights","split":"2N Cairo, 2N Hurghada","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Cairo"},{"n":2,"t":"Hurghada"}]},{"img":"2024/05/egypt-guided-tour.jpg","title":"Egypt Guided Tours 8 Nights","split":"2N Cairo, 3N Nile Cruise, 3N Hurghada","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Cairo"},{"n":3,"t":"Nile Cruise"},{"n":3,"t":"Hurghada"}]},{"img":"2024/05/best-of-egypt-tour.jpg","title":"Best of Egypt Tour 7 Nights","split":"2N Cairo, 3N Nile Cruise, 2N Hurghada","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Cairo"},{"n":3,"t":"Nile Cruise"},{"n":2,"t":"Hurghada"}]},{"img":"2024/05/e2-1.jpg","title":"Giza Pyramid Tour 6 Nights","split":"2N Cairo, 3N Nile Cruise, 1N Cairo","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Cairo"},{"n":3,"t":"Nile Cruise"},{"n":1,"t":"Cairo"}]},{"img":"2024/05/red-sea-tour.jpg","title":"Red Sea Tour 5 Nights","split":"2N Cairo, 3N Hurghada","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Cairo"},{"n":3,"t":"Hurghada"}]}],"thirdYears":true},"azerbaijan":{"name":"Azerbaijan","slug":"azerbaijan","url":"azerbaijan-dmc-india","notes":[],"topbar":null,"intro":["Azerbaijan, the land of fire, beauty, and culture, is a hidden gem waiting to be explored. And what better way to embark on this adventure than with Luxxata, the premier destination management company in Azerbaijan? With our unmatched services and expertise, we ensure that your visit to this enchanting country is nothing short of unforgettable.","We understand that every traveller is unique, which is why we offer customized itineraries tailored to your preferences and interests. Whether you're a history buff, a foodie, or an adventure seeker, we have the perfect itinerary for you. With Luxxata, you'll get an authentic Azerbaijani experience like no other.","From airport transfers to accommodation bookings, we take care of all the nitty-gritty details so you can focus on enjoying your trip. With Luxxata, you can rest assured that every aspect of your journey is taken care of. With Luxxata, you'll have access to unique experiences that are off the beaten path."],"slides":[{"img":"2024/05/azerbaijan-s1.jpg","cap":"Marvel at Baku’s modern wonders"},{"img":"2024/05/Sheki-Old-Town.jpg","cap":"Discover the Charm of Sheki’s Old Town"}],"hlTitle":"Azerbaijan Top Highlights","highlights":[["Rich Culture","Azerbaijan boasts a rich cultural heritage. From ancient historical sites to modern art galleries, there's something for every culture enthusiast."],["Breathtaking Landscapes","With its diverse landscapes ranging from the Caspian Sea to the Caucasus Mountains, Azerbaijan offers stunning natural beauty at every turn. Explore mud volcanoes, lush forests, and picturesque villages for a truly immersive experience."],["Culinary Delights","Azerbaijani cuisine is a true feast for the senses, with flavours and dishes that will tantalize your taste buds. From aromatic kebabs to mouth-watering pilafs, your culinary journey in Azerbaijan will be a highlight of your trip."],["Discovering Gabala","Situated in the heart of the Caucasus Mountains, Gabala is a charming city known for its rich history, cultural heritage, and breathtaking scenery. Explore the historic sites such as the ancient Gabala Castle and Juma Mosque, showcasing the city's past as a thriving cultural hub"],["Unveiling Shahdag","Nestled in the Greater Caucasus Mountains, Shahdag is a paradise for winter sports enthusiasts and nature lovers alike. Hit the slopes at the Shahdag Mountain Resort, offering world-class skiing and snowboarding facilities for all levels of expertise."]],"pkgTitle":"Azerbaijan Tour Packages","pkgSub":"thoughtfully curated Azerbaijan tour packages from India","pkgs":[{"img":"2025/02/old-city-baku-azerbaizan.jpg","title":"Spectacular Azerbaijan 6 Nights","split":"2N Baku 2N Gabala 1N Sheki 1N Baku","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Baku"},{"n":2,"t":"Gabala"},{"n":1,"t":"Sheki"},{"n":1,"t":"Baku"}]},{"img":"2025/02/baku-boulevard.jpg","title":"Stunning Azerbaijan Tour 5 Nights","split":"2N Baku, 2N Gabala, 1N Baku","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Baku"},{"n":2,"t":"Gabala"},{"n":1,"t":"Baku"}]},{"img":"2025/02/beaches-in-baku.jpg","title":"Unforgettable Baku 4 Nights","split":"4N Baku","stops":[{"n":4,"t":"Baku"}]},{"img":"2025/02/Highland-park-baku-azerbaijan.jpg","title":"Magical Baku 7 Nights","split":"6N Baku","stops":[{"n":6,"t":"Baku"}]},{"img":"2025/02/ateshgah-baku.jpg","title":"Explore Baku 6 Nights","split":"5N Baku","stops":[{"n":5,"t":"Baku"}]},{"img":"2025/02/baku-azerbaijan.jpg","title":"Best of Azerbaijan 5 Nights","split":"3N Baku, 2N Gabala","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"Baku"},{"n":2,"t":"Gabala"}]}],"whySub":"Azerbaijan DMC with best review portfolio and tours for customers of all genres"},"georgia":{"name":"Georgia","slug":"georgia","url":"georgia-dmc-india","notes":["FLAG: slides 4 and 5 describe Savannah and Bonaventure Cemetery, which are in Georgia, USA, not the country of Georgia. Reproduce as-is but list under CONFIRM."],"topbar":null,"intro":["Luxxata is a vibrant Destination Management Company (DMC) committed to creating exceptional travel experiences for corporations, groups, and individuals across Georgia. Our enthusiastic team possesses an in-depth knowledge of Georgia, and our objective is for visitors to depart with unforgettable memories.","We take pride in providing you with a diverse array of experiences and activities customized to your preferences. We facilitate business events throughout Georgia, including conferences, meetings, incentive travel, product launches, and gala dinners. They are meticulously researched, planned, and tailored to meet your specific needs.","Georgia is home to an ancient civilization that continues to uphold its distinctive identity, cultural heritage, and language. The country offers year-round outdoor adventures and boasts an impressive 8,000-year history of winemaking. We are driven by our dedication to customer satisfaction and provide travellers with authentic and varied experiences."],"slides":[{"img":"2024/05/georgia-s6-freindship-wall.jpg","cap":"Built for friendship, framed by mountains"},{"img":"2024/05/georgia-s8-batumi-city.jpg","cap":"Sun, sea, and a spin on the Alphabet Tower"},{"img":"2024/05/georgia-s7-batumi-city.jpg","cap":"Discover the Wonders of Georgia"},{"img":"2024/05/georgia-s4-trolly.jpg","cap":"Experience Stunning Savannah: A Trolley Tour Adventure"},{"img":"2024/05/georgia-s4-bonaventure-cemetery.jpg","cap":"Uncover the Fascinating History of Bonaventure Cemetery"}],"hlTitle":"Georgia Top Highlights","highlights":[["Cultural Heritage","Discover Georgia’s UNESCO World Heritage Sites, including Mtskheta, Gelati, and Upper Svaneti, which feature ancient churches and medieval architecture."],["Culinary Experiences","Savor iconic dishes such as khachapuri and khinkali while visiting farmers’ markets to discover local specialties. Relish Georgian favorites like lobio, chakapuli, and mtsvadi."],["Wine Exploration","Embark on a wine journey in Georgia, delving into its 8000-year-old winemaking tradition within traditional Qvevri cellars, elegant wineries, and rustic estates."],["Georgian Music, Dance, and Festivals","Immerse yourself in Georgian culture, featuring the UNESCO-recognized tradition of polyphonic singing and lively folk dances, along with vibrant festivals that highlight the nation’s warmth."],["Caucasus Mountains","Hike through rugged trails that meander alongside alpine meadows, glacial lakes, and majestic peaks. Uncover ancient villages while embracing the serene beauty."]],"pkgTitle":"Georgia Tour Packages","pkgSub":"Civilization that continues to uphold its distinctive identity, cultural heritage, and language","pkgs":[{"img":"2025/02/old-town-tbilisi-georgia.jpg","title":"Silk Road Treasure Georgia 6 Nights","split":"2N Tbilisi 1N Borjomi 1N Gudauri 2N Tbilisi","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Tbilisi"},{"n":1,"t":"Borjomi"},{"n":1,"t":"Gudauri"},{"n":2,"t":"Tbilisi"}]},{"img":"2025/02/hot-air-balloon-tbilisi.jpg","title":"Super Saver Tbilisi Holiday 4 Nights","split":"4N Tbilisi","stops":[{"n":4,"t":"Tbilisi"}]},{"img":"2025/02/tbilisi-georgia.jpg","title":"Almaty and Tbilisi Unveiled 7 Nights","split":"3N Almaty 4N Tbilisi","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"Almaty"},{"n":4,"t":"Tbilisi"}]},{"img":"2025/02/peace-bridge-tiblisi.jpg","title":"Georgia Unveiled 6 Nights","split":"3N Tbilisi 1N Borjomi 1N Kutaisi 1N Tbilisi","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"Tbilisi"},{"n":1,"t":"Borjomi"},{"n":1,"t":"Kutaisi"},{"n":1,"t":"Tbilisi"}]},{"img":"2025/02/tiblisi-georgia.jpg","title":"Serene Georgia 5 Nights","split":"5N Tbilisi","stops":[{"n":5,"t":"Tbilisi"}]},{"img":"2025/02/holy-trinity-cathedral-tbilisi.jpg","title":"Fully Loaded Georgia 6 Nights","split":"2N Tbilisi, 2N Batumi, 2N Tbilisi","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Tbilisi"},{"n":2,"t":"Batumi"},{"n":2,"t":"Tbilisi"}]}]},"turkey":{"name":"Turkey","slug":"turkey","url":"turkey-dmc-india","notes":[],"topbar":null,"intro":["When it comes to experiencing cultural richness, historical natural beauty, Turkey stands out as a top destination for both personal and corporate travel. If you're planning a trip to this enchanting country, choosing the right partner can make all the difference. Luxxata is your go-to agency for offering personalized and immersive experiences.","Luxxata provides exclusive access to unique experiences that are off the beaten path. Whether it's a private hot air balloon ride over Cappadocia or a private tour of Istanbul's vibrant markets, Luxxata ensures that you take home unforgettable memories from your Turkish adventure.","Turkey's allure lies in its captivating blend of history, culture, and natural beauty. With Luxxata, you can immerse yourself in this enchanting destination like never before. Embark on a journey that will leave you spellbound and yearning for more. Visit Turkey with Luxxata and let the magic unfold before your eyes."],"slides":[{"img":"2024/05/turkey-s2.jpg","cap":"Explore Stunning Views of Cappadocia from Above and below"},{"img":"2024/05/turkey-s5-marvels-in-istanbul.jpg","cap":"Admire Architectural Marvels in Istanbul"},{"img":"2024/05/turkey-s3.jpg","cap":"Explore the allure of Ancient Ephesus like a local"}],"hlTitle":"Turkey Top Highlights","highlights":[["Ephesus","Walking through ancient history: Step back in time at the ancient city of Ephesus, where you can walk along marble streets lined with well-preserved Roman ruins. The Library of Celsus are must-see attractions for history buffs."],["Pamukkale","The Cotton Castle: Pamukkale is a natural wonder that will leave you speechless. The cascading terraces of white mineral-rich water are both beautiful and therapeutic."],["Istanbul","Where East meets West: From the iconic Hagia Sophia to the bustling Grand Bazaar, there is no shortage of things to see and do in this vibrant city."],["Cappadocia","The Land of Fairy Chimneys: Towering rock formations are known as fairy chimneys. A hot air balloon ride at sunrise makes you experience the true magic of this enchanting region."],["Antalya","Turquoise Coast Paradise: Antalya is a coastal city with crystal clear waters, sandy beaches and a charming old town. Whether you're interested in water sports, or exploring ancient ruins, Antalya has something for everyone."]],"pkgTitle":"Turkey Tour Packages","pkgSub":"Experience cultural richness, historical natural beauty","pkgs":[{"img":"2025/02/cappadocia-turkey.jpg","title":"Turkey Trio 8 Nights","split":"3N Istanbul 2N Cappadocia 3N Antalya","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"Istanbul"},{"n":2,"t":"Cappadocia"},{"n":3,"t":"Antalya"}]},{"img":"2025/02/hot-air-balloon-turkey.jpg","title":"Enchanting  Turkey 9 Nights","split":"1N Ankara, 2N Cappadocia, 1N Konya, 1N Pamukkale, 1N Kusadasi, 1N Istanbul","stops":[{"n":1,"t":"Ankara"},{"n":2,"t":"Cappadocia"},{"n":1,"t":"Konya"},{"n":1,"t":"Pamukkale"},{"n":1,"t":"Kusadasi"},{"n":1,"t":"Istanbul"}]},{"img":"2025/02/instabul-turky.jpg","title":"Best of Turkey 6 Nights","split":"Istanbul, Cappadocia & Antalya","stops":null},{"img":"2025/02/hot-air-balloon-turkey2.jpg","title":"Turkish Delight 7 Nights","split":"Istanbul, Cappadocia & Antalya","stops":null},{"img":"2025/02/blue-mosque-instabul-turkey.jpg","title":"Turkish Treasures 10 Nights","split":"İstanbul, Cappadocia, Antalya, Fethiye, Pamukkale & Kusadasi","stops":null}]},"kazakhstan":{"name":"Kazakhstan","slug":"kazakhstan","url":"kazakhstan-dmc-india","notes":[],"topbar":null,"intro":["Kazakhstan is a stunning country filled with natural beauty and rich cultural heritage. To truly experience all that this gem has to offer, you need a reliable partner by your side. Luxxata is the ideal companion for both individual and corporate trips to Kazakhstan, ensuring a seamless and unforgettable journey.","Whether you're planning a solo adventure or a corporate retreat, Luxxata exceeds your expectations. For personal trips, Luxxata offers exclusive experiences, from luxury stays in boutique hotels to immersive cultural tours. Luxxata tailors activities to foster a sense of camaraderie for corporates for team-building, conferences and meetings.","Embark on a journey of discovery and exploration with Luxxata as your trusted partner. From the breathtaking landscapes to the vibrant cities, Kazakhstan is a country to inspire. Let Luxxata be your guide to this enchanting destination, and get ready for an unforgettable experience unlike any other."],"slides":[{"img":"2024/12/03_ultra-modern-Astana.jpg","cap":"Admire ultra-modern Astana like no other"},{"img":"2024/12/02_Shymbulak-adventure.jpg","cap":"Hit the adventurous slopes at Shymbulak"},{"img":"2024/12/01_Kazakh-culture-in-Almaty.jpg","cap":"Immerse yourself in Kazakh culture in Almaty"}],"hlTitle":"Kazakhstan Top Highlights","highlights":[["Nomadic Experience","Immerse yourself in the lifestyle of a self-sufficient nomad by spending the night in a Nomad yurt. On waking prepare your meals and engage in a lively dance inspired by nomadic traditions."],["Exclusive activities in diverse wild nature","Marvel at the stunning mountain lakes and listen to the enchanting melodies of the dunes. Traverse remote areas in an SUV, capturing memorable selfies against the backdrop of vibrant rocks that soar up to 400 meters above sea level."],["City tour in Almaty","Experience a Segway city tour in Almaty, ascend Kok-Tobe hill, and return to the city center via the Almaty cableway."],["Off-road tours","Specialized off-road tours to the 5 Canyons and trekking expeditions to the Butakovka Waterfall are also available."],["Rafting","For those seeking adventure, consider rafting on the Turgen River (June to September) or embark on a buggy tour through the Kaskelen Ravines."]],"pkgTitle":"Kazakhstan Tour Packages","pkgSub":"Natural beauty and rich cultural heritage","pkgs":[{"img":"2025/02/Mausoleum-of-Khoja-Ahmed-Yasawi_kazakhstan.jpg","title":"Memorable Almaty 8 Nights","split":"8N Almaty","stops":[{"n":8,"t":"Almaty"}]},{"img":"2025/02/Canyons-trekking-kazakhstan.jpg","title":"Discover Almaty 7 Nights","split":"7N Almaty","stops":[{"n":7,"t":"Almaty"}]},{"img":"2025/02/turgen-river-rafting-kazakhstan.jpg","title":"Almaty Adventure 6 Nights","split":"6N Almaty","stops":[{"n":6,"t":"Almaty"}]},{"img":"2025/02/big-almaty-lake-kazakhstan2.jpg","title":"Refreshing Almaty Trip 5 Nights","split":"5N Almaty","stops":[{"n":5,"t":"Almaty"}]},{"img":"2025/02/Astana-kazakhstan.jpg","title":"Serene Almaty 4 Nights","split":"4N Almaty","stops":[{"n":4,"t":"Almaty"}]}]},"uzbekistan":{"name":"Uzbekistan","slug":"uzbekistan","url":"uzbekistan-dmc-india","notes":[],"topbar":null,"intro":["If you are seeking a destination that combines rich history, stunning architecture, and warm hospitality, then Uzbekistan is the perfect place. And when it comes to planning your trip, Luxxata is your go-to partner for both your personal and corporate travel needs. Luxxata ensures that every aspect of your trip is carefully planned and executed.","Whether you are looking for a leisurely vacation or planning a team-building retreat, Luxxata can create a tailored itinerary to suit your specific requirements. From booking flights and accommodations tours and transportation, Luxxata takes care of all logistical details with precision and efficiency.","Choosing Luxxata guarantees a memorable and hassle-free travel experience. With tailored itineraries, seamless logistics, commitment to customer satisfaction, competitive pricing, and value-added services, Luxxata ensures creating unforgettable travel memories for you. Reach out to Luxxata today and embark on a journey of a lifetime!"],"slides":[{"img":"2024/12/de-uzbekistan.jpg","cap":"Marvel the historic architecture of the Silk Road"},{"img":"2024/12/de-uzbekistan-nukus-art-museum.jpg","cap":"Uncover Hidden treasures in Uzbekistan’s bazaars and art studios"}],"hlTitle":"Uzbekistan Top Highlights","highlights":[["Uncover the Secrets of Samarkand","Experience Samarkand, known as the \"Pearl of the Orient,\" featuring the stunning Registan complex adorned with blue domes, a UNESCO World Heritage site that has stood for 2,700 years."],["Discover the Magic of Traditional Yurts","Spend a night in traditional yurts, the nomadic dwellings, located in the Kyzlkum desert near Aydarkul Lake, and partake in a memorable camel riding adventure."],["Experience the World of Russian Avant","Immerse yourself in the world of Russian avant-garde modern art at the renowned Nukus Art Museum which has the second-largest collection after the Hermitage in St. Petersburg."],["Explore the Mysterious Ghost Town","Visit the ghost town of Muinak, once a thriving fishing community, now known for its ship cemetery."],["Witness the Shrinking Aral","Embark on an adventurous journey to witness the shrinking Aral Sea as you traverse the emerging Aralkum desert, the former seabed."]],"pkgTitle":"Uzbekistan Tour Packages","pkgSub":"Rich history, stunning architecture, and warm hospitality","pkgs":[{"img":"2025/02/Nukus-Art-Museum-Uzbekistan.jpg","title":"Vibrant Tashkent with Samarkand 4 Nights","split":"4N Tashkent","stops":[{"n":4,"t":"Tashkent"}]},{"img":"2025/02/camel-ride-Ayadarkul-Uzbekistan.jpg","title":"Discover Uzbekistan 6 Nights","split":"2N Tashkent 1N Samarkand 2N Bukhara 1N Tashkent","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Tashkent"},{"n":1,"t":"Samarkand"},{"n":2,"t":"Bukhara"},{"n":1,"t":"Tashkent"}]},{"img":"2025/02/samarkand-uzbekistan.jpg","title":"Serene Tashkent & Samarkand 6 Nights","split":"2N Tashkent 2N Samarkand 2N Tashkent","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Tashkent"},{"n":2,"t":"Samarkand"},{"n":2,"t":"Tashkent"}]},{"img":"2025/02/Nukus-Art-Museum-Uzbekistan2.jpg","title":"Memorable Tashkent 5 Nights","split":"5N Tashkent","stops":[{"n":5,"t":"Tashkent"}]},{"img":"2025/02/samarkand-uzbekistan2.jpg","title":"Getaway to Tashkent 4 Nights","split":"4N Tashkent","stops":[{"n":4,"t":"Tashkent"}]}]},"morocco":{"name":"Morocco","slug":"morocco","url":"morocco-dmc-india","notes":[],"topbar":null,"intro":["Luxxata, your premier Travel DMC for Morocco, welcomes you to a land where centuries-old traditions blend seamlessly with vibrant modern culture. From the colorful souks of Marrakech to the serene sands of the Sahara, Morocco is a feast for the senses—rich in history, hospitality, and hidden gems.","Whether you're wandering through the maze-like medinas, sipping mint tea in a tranquil riad, or watching the sun set over golden dunes, Luxxata ensures every moment of your Moroccan escape is curated to perfection. Our deep-rooted local connections and seasoned travel experts craft experiences that go beyond the ordinary.","Let Luxxata be your trusted partner for Morocco tour packages—whether it’s a cultural deep dive, a romantic desert getaway, or an incentive group journey, we deliver travel that truly resonates."],"slides":[{"img":"2025/04/1_Marrakech_Jemaa-el-Fnaa.jpg","cap":"Bustling square in the heart of Marrakech’s Medina"},{"img":"2025/04/Hassan-II-Mosque_Casablanca.jpg","cap":"One of the largest mosques in the world"},{"img":"2025/04/02_The-Blue-City_Chefchaouen3.jpg","cap":"Insta-famous for its blue-washed buildings"},{"img":"2025/04/Sahara-Desert-Morocco3.jpg","cap":"Camel treks, sand dunes, and stargazing"}],"hlTitle":"Morocco Top Highlights","highlights":[["Marrakech & Fes Medinas","Explore vibrant markets, age-old palaces, and hidden riads in two of Morocco’s most iconic cities. Ideal for cultural immersions and shopping lovers."],["Sahara Desert & Luxury Camps","Ride camels over sweeping dunes, enjoy dramatic sunsets, and spend the night under the stars at a luxury desert camp with Moroccan-style hospitality."],["Coastal Charms of Essaouira & Agadir","Perfect for beach holidays and seaside leisure. Fresh seafood, art scenes, and water sports create the ideal blend of relaxation and fun."],["Imperial Cities & Historical Tours","Visit Rabat, Meknes, and the architectural marvels of ancient Morocco. Perfect for classical tour itineraries with deep cultural exploration."],["Moroccan Cuisine & Nightlife","Savor tagines, couscous, and street-side mint tea by day—and by night, experience rooftop lounges and traditional music performances in buzzing cities."]],"pkgTitle":"Morocco Tour Packages","pkgSub":"From desert adventures to cultural circuits and beach breaks.","pkgs":[{"img":"2025/04/atlas-mountains_Imlil.jpg","title":"Mountains & Medinas 8 Nights","split":"2N Marrakech, 2N Imlil (Atlas Mountains), 2N Ouarzazate, 2N Fes","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Marrakech"},{"n":2,"t":"Imlil (Atlas Mountains)"},{"n":2,"t":"Ouarzazate"},{"n":2,"t":"Fes"}]},{"img":"2025/04/05-Hassan-II-Mosque_Casablanca.jpg","title":"Moroccan Nights 5 Nights","split":"2N Marrakech, 1N Agafay Desert, 2N Casablanca","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Marrakech"},{"n":1,"t":"Agafay Desert"},{"n":2,"t":"Casablanca"}]},{"img":"2025/04/HassanTower_Rabat_Morocco.jpg","title":"Imperial Cities Tour 6 Nights","split":"1N Casablanca, 2N Rabat, 1N Meknes, 2N Fes","stops":[{"n":1,"t":"Casablanca"},{"n":2,"t":"Rabat"},{"n":1,"t":"Meknes"},{"n":2,"t":"Fes"}]},{"img":"2025/04/essaouira-beach.jpg","title":"Beach & Culture Escape 7 Nights","split":"2N Casablanca, 2N Marrakech, 1N Essaouira, 2N Agadir","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Casablanca"},{"n":2,"t":"Marrakech"},{"n":1,"t":"Essaouira"},{"n":2,"t":"Agadir"}]},{"img":"2025/04/Merzouga_Luxury-Desert-Camp.jpg","title":"Sahara Desert Adventure 6 Nights","split":"1N Marrakech, 1N Ouarzazate, 1N Dades Valley, 1N Merzouga (Luxury Desert Camp), 1N Agdz, 1N Marrakech","stops":[{"n":1,"t":"Marrakech"},{"n":1,"t":"Ouarzazate"},{"n":1,"t":"Dades Valley"},{"n":1,"t":"Merzouga (Luxury Desert Camp)"},{"n":1,"t":"Agdz"},{"n":1,"t":"Marrakech"}]},{"img":"2025/04/1_Marrakech_Jemaa-el-Fnaa-1.jpg","title":"Morocco Coastal & Culture Combo 7 nights","split":"2N Casablanca, 2N Marrakech, 1N Essaouira, 2N Agadir","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Casablanca"},{"n":2,"t":"Marrakech"},{"n":1,"t":"Essaouira"},{"n":2,"t":"Agadir"}]},{"img":"2025/04/03_Fes-el-Bali_-Fez-Morocco.jpg","title":"Classic Morocco Tour 6 nights","split":"2N Marrakech, 1N Dades Valley, 1N Sahara Desert (Luxury Camp), 2N Fes","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Marrakech"},{"n":1,"t":"Dades Valley"},{"n":1,"t":"Sahara Desert (Luxury Camp)"},{"n":2,"t":"Fes"}]}]},"russia":{"name":"Russia","slug":"russia","url":"russia-dmc-india","notes":[],"topbar":["bookings@luxxata.com","+918595187025"],"intro":["Russia, the largest country in the world, is a land of grandeur, rich history, and architectural splendor. From the majestic Kremlin and Red Square in Moscow to the imperial elegance of St. Petersburg, every corner of Russia tells a fascinating story of culture, art, and innovation.","At Luxxata, we bring the magic of Russia to life with tailored travel experiences that offer insider access to the country’s most iconic sites. Whether it’s a private tour of the Hermitage Museum, a journey on the legendary Trans-Siberian Railway, or an exploration of the breathtaking landscapes of Lake Baikal, our expert team ensures a seamless and enriching journey.","With Luxxata, you can experience Russia in ultimate comfort and style. From luxury accommodations to exclusive cultural experiences, we handle all logistics, allowing you to fully immerse yourself in Russia’s fascinating history, vibrant traditions, and dynamic cities. Let Luxxata be your guide to an unforgettable Russian adventure."],"slides":[{"img":"2025/04/wildlife-at-kamchatka-peninsula.jpg","cap":"Where fire meets ice,  Russia’s wild frontier"},{"img":"2025/04/olkhon-island_lake-baikal.jpg","cap":"The soul of Siberia, ancient, deep, and pure"},{"img":"2025/04/st-basils-cathedrals-moscow.jpg","cap":"A fairytale in colors, Russia’s iconic crown"}],"hlTitle":"Russia Top Highlights","highlights":[["The Grandeur of Moscow & Red Square","Marvel at the iconic Red Square, home to the Kremlin, St. Basil’s Cathedral, and Lenin’s Mausoleum, a true representation of Russia’s historical power."],["World-Class Ballet & Theatrical Performances","Experience the magic of Russian ballet at the legendary Bolshoi Theatre in Moscow or the Mariinsky Theatre in St. Petersburg."],["The Winter Wonderland of Lake Baikal","Visit the deepest and oldest lake in the world, Lake Baikal, where frozen landscapes create a surreal winter paradise."],["Journey on the Legendary Trans-Siberian Railway","Embark on the ultimate adventure aboard the Trans-Siberian Railway, crossing breathtaking landscapes from Moscow to Vladivostok."],["Cruise the Majestic Volga River","Sail along Europe’s longest river, the Volga, passing through picturesque towns, monasteries, and historic landmarks."],["Vibrant Moscow & St. Petersburg Nightlife","From upscale cocktail bars to electrifying nightclubs, Russia’s nightlife is a blend of elegance and extravagance that caters to every traveler."]],"pkgTitle":"Russia Tour Packages","pkgSub":"Discover imperial cities, scenic landscapes, and epic adventures—only with Luxxata.","pkgs":[{"img":"2025/04/sochi-city.jpg","title":"Russia Family Fun Adventure 7 Nights","split":"2N Moscow, 2N Sochi, 3N St. Petersburg","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Moscow"},{"n":2,"t":"Sochi"},{"n":3,"t":"St. Petersburg"}]},{"img":"2025/04/Bolshoi-Theatre-Moscow.jpg","title":"Russia Cultural & Art Lovers Tour 8 Nights","split":"2N Moscow, 3N St. Petersburg, 3N Kazan","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Moscow"},{"n":3,"t":"St. Petersburg"},{"n":3,"t":"Kazan"}]},{"img":"2025/04/olkhon-island_lake-baikal-1.jpg","title":"Baikal Nature & Adventure Tour 7 Nights","split":"2N Irkutsk, 2N Olkhon Island, 3N Lake Baikal Camp","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Irkutsk"},{"n":2,"t":"Olkhon Island"},{"n":3,"t":"Lake Baikal Camp"}]},{"img":"2025/04/Red-square-Moscow.jpg","title":"Luxury Russia Escape 6 Nights","split":"3N Moscow, 3N St. Petersburg","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"Moscow"},{"n":3,"t":"St. Petersburg"}]},{"img":"2025/04/trans-siberian-railway.jpg","title":"Trans-Siberian Express Journey 12 Nights","split":"Moscow to Vladivostok (train route) , Stopovers: Yekaterinburg, Novosibirsk, Irkutsk (Lake Baikal), Ulan-Ude","stops":null},{"img":"2025/04/Volga-River-Cruise.jpg","title":"Volga River Cruise Experience 8 Nights","split":"2N Moscow, 5N Cruise(Uglich, Yaroslavl, Goritsy, Kizhi), 1N St. Petersburg","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Moscow"},{"n":5,"t":"Cruise(Uglich, Yaroslavl, Goritsy, Kizhi)"},{"n":1,"t":"St. Petersburg"}]},{"img":"2025/04/Teriberka-Northern-Lights-Russia.jpg","title":"Winter Wonderland & Northern Lights 6 Nights","split":"1N Moscow, 1N Murmansk, 2N Teriberka (Northern Lights) , 2N Moscow","stops":[{"n":1,"t":"Moscow"},{"n":1,"t":"Murmansk"},{"n":2,"t":"Teriberka (Northern Lights)"},{"n":2,"t":"Moscow"}]},{"img":"2025/04/suzdal-kremlin-cathedral.jpg","title":"Golden Ring Discovery 7 Nights","split":"2N Moscow, 1N Vladimir, 1N Suzdal, 1N Yaroslavl, 2N Moscow","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Moscow"},{"n":1,"t":"Vladimir"},{"n":1,"t":"Suzdal"},{"n":1,"t":"Yaroslavl"},{"n":2,"t":"Moscow"}]},{"img":"2025/04/Church-of-the-Savior-on-Spilled-Blood.jpg","title":"Imperial Russia Circuit 8 Nights","split":"3N St. Petersburg, 1N Veliky Novgorod, 4N Moscow","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"St. Petersburg"},{"n":1,"t":"Veliky Novgorod"},{"n":4,"t":"Moscow"}]},{"img":"2025/04/st-basils-cathedrals-moscow.jpg","title":"Classic Russia Tour 6 Nights","split":"3N Moscow, 3N St. Petersburg","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"Moscow"},{"n":3,"t":"St. Petersburg"}]}],"thirdYears":true},"vietnam":{"name":"Vietnam","slug":"vietnam","url":"vietnam-dmc-india","notes":[],"topbar":null,"intro":["Vietnam, a land of breathtaking natural beauty, rich cultural heritage, and vibrant cities, offers an unforgettable travel experience. From the stunning limestone karsts of Ha Long Bay to the historic charm of Hanoi’s Old Quarter and the bustling streets of Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam is a destination that captivates every traveler.","At Luxxata, we specialize in crafting immersive and seamless journeys through Vietnam. Whether it’s a tranquil cruise along the Mekong Delta, an exploration of the ancient town of Hoi An, or an adventure through the terraced rice fields of Sapa, our expertly curated itineraries ensure a journey filled with wonder and discovery.","From luxury accommodations to authentic local experiences, our team ensures that every aspect of your Vietnam trip is flawlessly planned and executed. Whether you're indulging in the country's renowned street food, discovering the history of the Cu Chi Tunnels, or simply soaking in the natural beauty, Luxxata is your trusted partner for an extraordinary Vietnam experience."],"slides":[{"img":"2025/04/halong-bay-vietnam.jpg","cap":"A dream for nature lovers and photographers"},{"img":"2025/04/Phong-Nha-Ke_Bang-National-Park.jpg","cap":"Home to some of the world’s largest caves like Son Doong"},{"img":"2025/04/golden-bridge-in-vietnam3.jpg","cap":"A giant hand holding up a bridge in the clouds"}],"hlTitle":"Vietnam Top Highlights","highlights":[["Cruise Through the Stunning Ha Long Bay","Sail through the emerald waters of Ha Long Bay, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, and witness its breathtaking limestone karsts and hidden caves."],["Step Back in Time in Hoi An Ancient Town","Explore the lantern-lit streets of Hoi An, where ancient temples, traditional wooden houses, and vibrant markets transport you to Vietnam’s rich past."],["Immerse Yourself in Nature at Sapa & Mekong Delta","Discover the breathtaking rice terraces of Sapa, trek through lush mountain landscapes, and experience the floating markets along the Mekong Delta."],["Uncover Vietnam’s War History at Cu Chi Tunnels","Step into the historic Cu Chi Tunnels, an underground network used during the Vietnam War, offering a fascinating glimpse into the country’s past."],["Bustling Night Markets & Lively Nightlife","From night markets brimming with unique finds to trendy rooftop bars and beachside parties, Vietnam comes alive after sunset."]],"pkgTitle":"Vietnam Tour Packages","pkgSub":"From vibrant cities to serene bays, explore the best of Vietnam with Luxxata.","pkgs":[{"img":"2025/04/golden-bridge-in-vietnam.jpg","title":"Vietnam Family Fun Tour 7 Nights","split":"2N Ho Chi Minh, 2N Da Nang, 3N Hanoi","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Ho Chi Minh"},{"n":2,"t":"Da Nang"},{"n":3,"t":"Hanoi"}]},{"img":"2025/04/Beach-Nha-Trang-Vietnam.jpg","title":"Vietnam Beach & Relaxation Tour 7 Nights","split":"3N Da Nang, 2N Nha Trang, 2N Phu Quoc","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"Da Nang"},{"n":2,"t":"Nha Trang"},{"n":2,"t":"Phu Quoc"}]},{"img":"2025/04/Inside-Ben-Thanh-Market-ho-chi-minh-city.jpg","title":"Vietnam Cultural Circuit 8 Nights","split":"2N Hanoi, 1N Halong Bay, 2N Hue, 1N Da Nang, 2N Hoi An","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Hanoi"},{"n":1,"t":"Halong Bay"},{"n":2,"t":"Hue"},{"n":1,"t":"Da Nang"},{"n":2,"t":"Hoi An"}]},{"img":"2025/04/Phong-Nha-Ke_Bang-National-Park-1.jpg","title":"South Vietnam Discovery 6 Nights","split":"2N Ho Chi Minh City, 2N Mekong Delta, 2N Phu Quoc Island","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Ho Chi Minh City"},{"n":2,"t":"Mekong Delta"},{"n":2,"t":"Phu Quoc Island"}]},{"img":"2025/04/Muong-Hoa-Valley.jpg","title":"North Vietnam Adventure 7 Nights","split":"3N Hanoi, 2N Sapa (Mountain Villages), 1N Halong Bay, 1N Ninh Binh","stops":[{"n":3,"t":"Hanoi"},{"n":2,"t":"Sapa (Mountain Villages)"},{"n":1,"t":"Halong Bay"},{"n":1,"t":"Ninh Binh"}]},{"img":"2025/04/hoi-an-ancient-town-vietnam.jpg","title":"Classic Vietnam Tour 6 Nights","split":"2N Hanoi, 1N Halong Bay (Overnight Cruise), 1N Hue, 2N Hoi An","stops":[{"n":2,"t":"Hanoi"},{"n":1,"t":"Halong Bay (Overnight Cruise)"},{"n":1,"t":"Hue"},{"n":2,"t":"Hoi An"}]}],"thirdYears":true}},"destOrder":["jordan","egypt","azerbaijan","georgia","turkey","kazakhstan","uzbekistan","morocco","russia","vietnam"],"home":{"hero":{"eyebrow":"Exclusive B2B holiday deals for global destinations","h":"The world’s most trusted Destination Management Company.","sub":"Expert partners across the globe who specialise in the power of local knowledge.","btn":"Request a Proposal"},"slides":[{"name":"Egypt","img":"2024/05/egypt-1.jpg"},{"name":"Jordan","img":"2024/05/jordan-1.jpg"},{"name":"Azerbaijan","img":"2024/05/azerbaijan-1.jpg"},{"name":"Georgia","img":"2024/05/georgia.jpg"},{"name":"Turkey","img":"2024/05/turkey-1.jpg"},{"name":"Kazakhstan","img":"2024/12/kazakhstan.jpg"},{"name":"Uzbekistan","img":"2024/12/uzbekistan2.jpg"},{"name":"Morocco","img":"2025/04/homepage-slider-morocco.jpg"},{"name":"Russia","img":"2025/04/russia-slider-homepage-banner.jpg"},{"name":"Vietnam","img":"2025/04/vietnam-slider-home.jpg"}],"what":[["Destination consultancy","We are a DMC offering travel agents with all the know-how about destinations just like a local."],["Corporate events","Unmatched competence for perform corporate events and incentive tours."],["Leisure Trips","Be it family trips, school students, HNIs, CEOs or the expats, we have just the right services for all genre."],["Destinations","With the Power of Local Knowledge, We create successful travel experiences making every dollar spent worth."]],"readMore":"read more...","touch":"fill up this quick query form and one of our expert travel specialists will revert to you soon","destSub":"With the Power of Local Knowledge, We create successful group travel experiences for you."},"articles":[{"n":1,"img":"2024/05/tbilisi-georgia.jpg","title":"Georgia: The Perfect MICE Destination for Unforgettable Corporate Events","excerpt":"Nestled in the heart of the Caucasus region, Georgia emerges as an ideal MICE (Meetings,...","url":"/georgia-the-perfect-mice-destination-for-unforgettable-corporate-events/","slug":"georgia-the-perfect-mice-destination-for-unforgettable-corporate-events","flag":false,"body":"<p>Nestled in the heart of the Caucasus region, Georgia emerges as an ideal MICE (Meetings, Incentives, Conferences, and Events) destination, seamlessly blending modern infrastructure with historic charm and breathtaking landscapes. As a vibrant hub for business and leisure, Georgia offers a unique setting for corporate events that leave a lasting impression on attendees.</p><blockquote>Tbilisi, the capital city of Georgia, serves as the perfect backdrop for corporate gatherings, boasting modern conference facilities, state-of-the-art hotels, and a rich cultural heritage. The city's historic charm, evident in its cobblestone streets and ancient architecture, adds a touch of authenticity and allure to any event.</blockquote><p>What sets Georgia apart as a MICE destination is its wealth of unique venues and experiences. Imagine hosting a conference in a historic opera house, a networking event in a medieval fortress, or a gala dinner overlooking the majestic Caucasus Mountains. With the expertise of a Destination Management Company (DMC), events can be curated to reflect the unique culture and beauty of Georgia, creating unforgettable experiences for attendees.</p><p>Georgia's rich cultural heritage offers ample opportunities for team building and cultural immersion. From exploring ancient UNESCO World Heritage sites to experiencing traditional Georgian hospitality in rural villages, corporate teams can bond over shared experiences that foster teamwork, communication, and leadership skills.</p><p>For teams seeking adventure and wellness activities, Georgia offers an array of options. Outdoor adventures such as hiking in the Caucasus Mountains, wine tasting in the scenic Kakheti region, or rejuvenating spa treatments at luxurious resorts provide opportunities for relaxation and rejuvenation.</p><p><em>With meticulous planning and execution by a DMC, corporate events in Georgia are seamless and stress-free, allowing organizers to focus on the success of their event. Georgia truly offers the perfect combination of modern amenities, cultural richness, and natural beauty, making it an unforgettable destination for corporate gatherings. Contact us today to start planning your next corporate event in Georgia, where business meets pleasure amidst breathtaking landscapes and rich cultural experiences.</em></p>","read":"2"},{"n":2,"img":"2024/05/azerbaijan-2.jpg","title":"Azerbaijan: The Ideal MICE Destination for Unforgettable Corporate Retreats","excerpt":"In the landscape of corporate retreats and MICE destinations Azerbaijan shines as a hidden gem...","url":"/azerbaijan-the-ideal-mice-destination-for-unforgettable-corporate-retreats/","slug":"azerbaijan-the-ideal-mice-destination-for-unforgettable-corporate-retreats","flag":false,"body":"<p>In the landscape of corporate retreats and MICE (Meetings, Incentives, Conferences, & Events) destinations Azerbaijan shines as a hidden gem awaiting exploration. Situated at the crossroads of Europe and Asia, this dynamic country offers a perfect fusion of modern amenities, cultural richness, and natural splendor, making it the ultimate destination for unforgettable corporate retreats. Let's delve into why Azerbaijan should be at the forefront of your considerations for your next corporate getaway.</p><blockquote>Azerbaijan boasts modern infrastructure and state-of-the-art facilities perfectly suited to accommodate corporate groups. The capital city of Baku, with its striking skyline and contemporary architecture, serves as a dynamic backdrop for corporate events. From world-class conference centers to luxurious hotels and resorts, Azerbaijan provides all the necessary amenities for a successful corporate retreat.</blockquote><p>What sets Azerbaijan apart as a MICE destination is its wealth of unique venues and experiences. Picture hosting a networking event in a historic caravanserai, team-building activities amidst the rugged landscapes of the Caucasus Mountains, or a gala dinner overlooking the shimmering waters of the Caspian Sea. With our expertise as a Destination Management Company (DMC), we can curate tailor-made experiences that leave a lasting impression on your team.</p><p>Azerbaijan's rich cultural heritage offers ample opportunities for team building and cultural immersion. From exploring ancient UNESCO World Heritage sites like the Old City of Baku to experiencing traditional Azerbaijani hospitality in rural villages, your team will forge bonds over shared experiences that transcend the office environment. Our team at LUXXATA specializes in designing programs that foster teamwork, communication, and leadership skills in inspiring settings across Azerbaijan.</p><p>For teams seeking adventure and wellness activities, Azerbaijan offers an array of options. Embark on thrilling outdoor adventures such as hiking in the majestic Caucasus Mountains, horseback riding in the picturesque Sheki region, or sailing on the vast Caspian Sea. Alternatively, unwind and rejuvenate with spa treatments at luxurious resorts or yoga sessions amidst breathtaking landscapes.</p><p><em>With LUXXATA by your side, planning a corporate retreat becomes a seamless and stress-free experience. From conceptualization to execution, our experienced team handles every aspect of your retreat, ensuring a memorable and impactful experience for you and your team. Azerbaijan awaits as the perfect canvas for your next corporate getaway—contact us today to begin planning your unforgettable journey.</em></p>","read":"2"},{"n":3,"img":"2024/05/citadel-jordan-blog.jpg","title":"Unforgettable Incentive Travel: Why Jordan Should Be Your Next Destination","excerpt":"In the realm of incentive travel, where each journey is crafted to reward, motivate, and...","url":"/unforgettable-incentive-travel-why-jordan-should-be-your-next-destination/","slug":"unforgettable-incentive-travel-why-jordan-should-be-your-next-destination","flag":false,"body":"<p>In the realm of incentive travel, where each journey is crafted to reward, motivate, and inspire, Jordan stands out as a destination of unparalleled allure. Nestled at the crossroads of history, culture, and adventure, this mesmerizing land offers a wealth of experiences that promise to elevate your next incentive trip to new heights. At LUXXATA , we invite you to discover why Jordan should be your ultimate destination for unforgettable incentive travel.</p><h3>Ancient Wonders and Timeless Treasures</h3><p>Jordan is home to some of the world's most iconic historical sites, including the legendary city of Petra. Carved into rose-red cliffs by the Nabataeans over 2,000 years ago, Petra's majestic architecture and rich heritage make it a truly awe-inspiring destination for incentive travelers seeking to immerse themselves in history and culture.</p><h3>Spectacular Landscapes and Outdoor Adventures</h3><p>From the dramatic deserts of Wadi Rum to the serene waters of the Dead Sea, Jordan's diverse landscapes offer endless opportunities for outdoor exploration and adventure. Whether it's hiking, camel trekking, or floating effortlessly in the buoyant waters of the Dead Sea, incentive travelers can experience the thrill of discovery in Jordan's breathtaking natural beauty.</p><h3>Authentic Experiences and Cultural Encounters</h3><p>Jordan's warm hospitality and vibrant culture create the perfect backdrop for meaningful and authentic travel experiences. From savoring traditional Jordanian cuisine in a local family home to participating in a traditional Bedouin ceremony under the starlit desert sky, incentive travelers can forge lasting connections and create cherished memories with the people and communities of Jordan.</p><h3>Luxury and Comfort Amidst Timeless Beauty</h3><p>In Jordan, luxury and comfort seamlessly blend with the country's timeless beauty and rich heritage. From opulent resorts and boutique hotels to lavish desert camps and exclusive dining experiences, incentive travelers can indulge in the finest accommodations and amenities while exploring the wonders of Jordan in style and elegance.</p><h3>Seamless Planning and Tailored Experiences</h3><p>At LUXXATA, we specialize in crafting bespoke incentive travel experiences that exceed expectations and leave a lasting impression. From personalized itineraries and VIP treatment to flawless logistics and attentive service, our team ensures that every detail is meticulously planned and flawlessly executed, allowing incentive travelers to relax, unwind, and focus on creating unforgettable memories.</p><p><em>In summary, Jordan offers a captivating blend of history, culture, adventure, and luxury that makes it the perfect destination for unforgettable incentive travel experiences. Let LUXXATA be your trusted partner in planning your next incentive trip to Jordan, where extraordinary adventures and unforgettable memories await. Contact us today to start planning your journey to the heart of the Middle East's most enchanting destination.</em></p>","read":"2"},{"n":4,"img":"2024/05/Petra-jordan-blog.jpg","title":"The Ultimate Guide to Traveling Responsibly in Jordan: Sustainable Tourism Practices","excerpt":"In recent years, there has been a growing awareness of the importance of sustainable tourism...","url":"/the-ultimate-guide-to-traveling-responsibly-in-jordan-sustainable-tourism-practices/","slug":"the-ultimate-guide-to-traveling-responsibly-in-jordan-sustainable-tourism-practices","flag":false,"body":"<p>In recent years, there has been a growing awareness of the importance of sustainable tourism practices, not only for preserving the natural and cultural heritage of destinations but also for supporting local communities and minimizing environmental impact. At LUXXATA, we believe in responsible travel and are committed to promoting sustainable tourism in Jordan. Here's our ultimate guide to traveling responsibly in the Hashemite Kingdom:</p><h3>Respect Local Culture and Customs</h3><p>Jordan is a country rich in history, culture, and traditions. When visiting historical sites, religious monuments, or interacting with local communities, it's essential to show respect for their customs and way of life. Dress modestly, ask for permission before taking photos, and be mindful of cultural sensitivities.</p><h3>Support Local Communities</h3><p>One of the best ways to contribute positively to the local economy is by supporting local businesses, artisans, and tour operators. Stay in locally-owned accommodations, dine at family-run restaurants, and purchase souvenirs directly from craftsmen and women. By investing in the local economy, travelers can help create sustainable livelihoods for communities across Jordan.</p><h3>Reduce Your Environmental Footprint</h3><p>Minimize your impact on the environment by practicing responsible tourism habits. Opt for eco-friendly transportation options, such as public buses or shared taxis, whenever possible. Reduce waste by carrying a reusable water bottle, saying no to single-use plastics, and disposing of trash responsibly. Choose accommodations that prioritize sustainability and conservation efforts, such as eco-lodges or hotels with green certifications.</p><h3>Conserve Water and Energy</h3><p>Water scarcity is a significant environmental issue in Jordan, making it crucial for travelers to use resources wisely. Take shorter showers, reuse towels, and turn off lights and air conditioning when leaving your room. Support hotels and resorts that implement water-saving measures and invest in renewable energy sources.</p><h3>Practice Responsible Outdoor Recreation</h3><p>Whether hiking in nature reserves, diving in the Red Sea, or exploring desert landscapes, it's essential to minimize your impact on fragile ecosystems. Stay on designated trails, avoid disturbing wildlife, and follow Leave No Trace principles. Choose tour operators and guides who prioritize conservation and environmental stewardship.</p><p>By adopting these sustainable tourism practices, travelers can make a positive difference while exploring the breathtaking landscapes, ancient wonders, and vibrant culture of Jordan. At LUXXATA, we're committed to promoting responsible travel and ensuring that future generations can continue to enjoy the beauty and diversity of this remarkable destination. Join us in traveling responsibly and preserving the treasures of Jordan for generations to come.</p>","read":"2"},{"n":5,"img":"2024/05/turkey-mosque-blog1.jpg","title":"Top 10 Must-Visit Destinations in Turkey: A DMC’s Guide.","excerpt":"Are you planning a trip to Turkey and wondering where to go? With its rich...","url":"/top-10-must-visit-destinations-in-turkey-a-dmcs-guide/","slug":"top-10-must-visit-destinations-in-turkey-a-dmcs-guide","flag":false},{"n":6,"img":"2024/05/thailand-1.jpg","title":"Unlock Egypt’s Enchantment: Book a Trip with DMC for Unmatched Adventure!","excerpt":"Embarking on a journey to Egypt is like stepping into a world of enchantment, where...","url":"/unlock-egypts-enchantment-book-a-trip-with-dmc-for-unmatched-adventure/","slug":"unlock-egypts-enchantment-book-a-trip-with-dmc-for-unmatched-adventure","flag":true},{"n":7,"img":"2024/05/turkey-capadocia-blog1.jpg","title":"The Ultimate Guide to Turkish Cuisine: Foodie Adventures with Your DMC.","excerpt":"Embark on a flavorful journey with LUXXATA as we dive deep into the culinary wonders...","url":"/the-ultimate-guide-to-turkish-cuisine-foodie-adventures-with-your-dmc/","slug":"the-ultimate-guide-to-turkish-cuisine-foodie-adventures-with-your-dmc","flag":false},{"n":8,"img":"2024/05/cable-car_tbilisi-georgia.jpg","title":"Cultural Crossroads: Immersive Experiences in Georgia with Our DMC","excerpt":"Georgia, nestled at the crossroads of Europe and Asia, invites travelers on a journey of...","url":"/cultural-crossroads-immersive-experiences-in-georgia-with-our-dmc/","slug":"cultural-crossroads-immersive-experiences-in-georgia-with-our-dmc","flag":false},{"n":9,"img":"2024/05/thailand-1.jpg","title":"Beyond the Capital: Exploring Azerbaijan’s Enchanting Regions with Our DMC","excerpt":"Welcome to Azerbaijan, where ancient history, breathtaking landscapes, and vibrant culture converge to create a...","url":"/beyond-the-capital-exploring-azerbaijans-enchanting-regions-with-our-dmc/","slug":"beyond-the-capital-exploring-azerbaijans-enchanting-regions-with-our-dmc","flag":true},{"n":10,"img":"2024/01/egypt_blog1.jpg","title":"Why Should You Consider Booking a Trip to Egypt with DMC?","excerpt":"Setting off on a journey to Egypt is a dream for many, but navigating its...","url":"/why-should-you-consider-booking-a-trip-to-egypt-with-dmc/","slug":"why-should-you-consider-booking-a-trip-to-egypt-with-dmc","flag":false}],"sidebar":{"recent":["georgia-the-perfect-mice-destination-for-unforgettable-corporate-events","azerbaijan-the-ideal-mice-destination-for-unforgettable-corporate-retreats","unforgettable-incentive-travel-why-jordan-should-be-your-next-destination","the-ultimate-guide-to-traveling-responsibly-in-jordan-sustainable-tourism-practices"],"categories":["Beaches & Adventure","Best Time to Travel","Culinary and History","Food & Wine","Historical Monuments","History & Cultural","Wildlife and Adventure"],"archives":["May 2024","March 2024","February 2024","January 2024"],"tags":["Incentive Travel","Tailored Experiences","Culinary Adventure","Egypt DMC","Turkey DMC","Jordan DMC","Turkish Cuisine","Azerbaijan DMC","Georgia DMC"]},"about":{"banner":"2024/05/abt-banner-1.jpg","html":"<h2>Welcome to Luxxata</h2><p>Experience Travel Like Never Before with Luxxata</p><blockquote>Luxxata is a leading destination management company that specializes in delivering tailored solutions for both corporate clients and individuals. When you partner with Luxxata, you enjoy the experience of travel done differently—a uniquely designed travel program, built with you and for you, expertly delivered in the six regions we operate in: Jordan, Turkey, Georgia, Kazakhstan, Uzbekistan, and Azerbaijan.</blockquote><p>We design corporate travel programs that drive strategic results for every part of your business and every member of your team in every region you operate in.</p><h2>That’s the Luxxata difference.</h2><p>If you are looking for a tailored travel management solution, delivering excellence in customer service and a clear return on investment, you’re in the right place.</p><p>Operating in six strategically chosen countries, Luxxata leverages its regional expertise to create bespoke itineraries. Whether it's hosting a high-profile conference in a bustling city or organizing a team-building retreat in a serene countryside, Luxxata's dedicated team ensures that all your corporate objectives are met.</p><h2>Transforming Your Corporate Gatherings into Memorable Experiences</h2><p>Planning a company incentive trip, a group tour, a successful conference, meeting, or special event can be daunting, especially when navigating unfamiliar territory. However, with Luxxata by your side, you can rest assured that you are in capable hands. Our extensive network of local vendors and service providers enables us to deliver exceptional experiences tailored to your specific needs and objectives. Whether it’s arranging transportation, coordinating activities, or providing on-the-ground support, we work tirelessly to ensure that every aspect of your event is meticulously planned and executed. Our commitment to excellence means that you can focus on what truly matters—engaging with your attendees and achieving your desired outcomes.</p><h2>Planning Your Dream Vacation</h2><p>For individuals, Luxxata offers personalized travel and event management services that cater to various needs and preferences. Whether it's planning a dream vacation, organizing a special celebration, or arranging exclusive experiences, Luxxata prioritizes client satisfaction and attention to detail. Our team works closely with individuals to understand their desires and create bespoke itineraries that exceed expectations. By combining local insights with exceptional service, Luxxata ensures that every experience of yours is memorable and perfectly executed.</p><h2>Our Services</h2><h3>Travel Options without breaking the bank</h3><ul><li>We understand the importance of budget-friendly travel options for corporates and individuals.</li><li>Our team works tirelessly to curate cost-effective itineraries without compromising on the quality of the experience.</li><li>From affordable accommodation options to budget-friendly activities, we ensure that every penny you spend is worth it.</li></ul><h3>Exceptional Experiences for Luxury Clients</h3><ul><li>Luxxata specializes in curating exceptional experiences for corporate clients seeking luxury and sophistication.</li><li>From exclusive venue sourcing to bespoke itineraries, the team at Luxxata is dedicated to crafting unforgettable moments that resonate with the brand identity of each client.</li></ul><h3>Memorable Incentive Tours</h3><ul><li>Incentive tours are a great way to motivate and reward your employees or clients.</li><li>We specialize in creating incentive tours that align with your company's goals and objectives.</li><li>Let us help you design a memorable incentive trip that will leave a lasting impression on your team.</li></ul><h3>Corporate Events Aligning with Business Objectives</h3><ul><li>Planning a corporate event can be a daunting task, but with our expertise, we make it seamless.</li><li>From event logistics to transportation, we handle every aspect of your corporate event with precision and professionalism.</li><li>Elevate with our upscale event planning services.</li></ul><h3>Impactful Tour Options for High-Net-Worth Individuals</h3><ul><li>With a keen understanding of the unique needs and preferences of affluent clients, Luxxata offers an array of services that encompass everything from personalized interior design to comprehensive project management.</li><li>Our approach is centred around creating spaces that not only reflect the client’s aesthetic vision but also enhance their lifestyle, ensuring that every detail is meticulously crafted to meet the highest standards of luxury and sophistication.</li></ul><blockquote>We are not just a destination management company; we are your partner in creating unforgettable experiences. Whether you are a budget traveller, or corporate entity, we have the expertise to cater to your specific needs. Trust us to plan your next trip or event, and we guarantee excellence in every detail.</blockquote>"},"contact":{"banner":"2024/05/abt-banner-1.jpg","lead":"For any inquiries or concerns, please contact us at:","email":"bookings@luxxata.com","phone":"+91 85951 87025","address":"Second Floor, 622, B1 Rd, Block B1, Janakpuri, New Delhi - 110058"}};